WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.000
<v Narrator>Everything you're about to see gets done by voice.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.070
<v Narrator>No typing. No tapping.

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:08.290
<v Narrator>Just LazyTradie Copilot.

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:13.570
<v Copilot>Good morning! What can I sort out for you?

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:15.410
<v Jack>What's on today?

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:16.710
<v Copilot>Pulling up today…

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:18.340
<v Copilot>You've got four jobs.

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:21.490
<v Copilot>First up, Liam in Richmond at 8.

00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:24.810
<v Jack>Find Sarah's switchboard job.

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:26.990
<v Copilot>Finding Sarah's job…

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:30.710
<v Copilot>Switchboard upgrade in Hawthorn, Thursday at 9.

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:32.590
<v Copilot>It's waiting on your approval.

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:36.590
<v Jack>Approve it, and move it to Friday at two.

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:41.460
<v Copilot>Updating that… Approved, and moved to Friday at 2 PM.

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:44.770
<v Jack>Book Mike Chen tomorrow at ten.

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:47.630
<v Jack>Two downlights, Smith Street, Fitzroy.

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:54.270
<v Copilot>Book Mike, two downlights, Smith St Fitzroy, tomorrow at 10 AM?

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:55.340
<v Jack>Yep.

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:57.880
<v Copilot>Booked in for tomorrow at 10.

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:00.710
<v Jack>Add a note to Mike's job…

00:01:00.710 --> 00:01:02.300
<v Jack>bring the long ladder.

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:03.870
<v Copilot>Adding that note…

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:06.070
<v Copilot>Done. It's on Mike's job.

00:01:07.070 --> 00:01:09.520
<v Jack>Quote Sarah for the switchboard upgrade.

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:11.760
<v Copilot>Drafting Sarah's quote…

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:16.690
<v Copilot>$2,450 for the switchboard upgrade.

00:01:16.690 --> 00:01:18.430
<v Copilot>Tap confirm to send.

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:21.700
<v Jack>Invoice Liam's job from this morning.

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:24.080
<v Copilot>Checking Liam's job…

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:26.890
<v Copilot>Invoice drafted, $380.

00:01:26.890 --> 00:01:28.880
<v Copilot>Tap confirm to send.

00:01:30.070 --> 00:01:32.190
<v Narrator>Your schedule. Your jobs.

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:33.820
<v Narrator>Your quotes and invoices…

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:36.210
<v Narrator>sorted. Just by asking.

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:40.310
<v Copilot>Afternoon, mate. What's next on the list?
